 "meta": {
  "known_bug": null,
  "notes": "over with_vbt_indicators' output (compressed config, 20-DMA). Inputs are JSON and each function is called from them after a JSON round trip. Decimals are strings; dates are ISO days; enums are their values; polars frames are {columns, dtypes, rows}; numpy matrices are row lists with NaN as null. config is a whole VbtConfig decoded by each sub-dataclass's declared field types (exits.qulla is the swing StopConfig). A SessionCalendar is {sessions, dropped, counts}. A raise is {raises: {type, message}}. Expression-valued functions are golden as their value over inputs.frame. Synthetic seeded fixtures, rounded before they are written. Regenerate with `PYTHONPATH=..:packages/core/src:packages/providers/src:packages/execution/src .venv/bin/python ../tools/parity/golden_vbt.py` from decile-blueprint.",
  "stable": true,
  "tolerance": {
   "float": 1e-09
  }
 },
